# ============================================================
# INTERNAL DOCUMENTATION & AI TASK ARTIFACTS
# (personal audit logs, planning drafts, agent-created task docs)
#
# Pattern rules — any file matching these is auto-excluded:
#   *_analysis.md     e.g. reclassification_analysis.md
#   *_review.md       e.g. PROJECT_REVIEW.md
#   *_audit.md        e.g. dependency_audit.md
#   *_cleanup.md      e.g. db_cleanup.md
#   *_report.md       e.g. coverage_report.md (root-level only)
#   *_migration*.md   e.g. category_migration_plan.md
#   TODO_*.md         e.g. TODO_MYPY.md
#   implementation_plan*.md   agent planning artifacts (GEMINI.md §3.1)
#
# Named permanent project docs (README, SECURITY, SBOM, PRD, etc.)
# are tracked normally — they do NOT match any of these patterns.
# ============================================================
backend/scripts/deleted_receipts_log.md
backend/scripts/output.txt
# lowercase variants (agent-created files)
*_analysis.md
*_review.md
*_audit.md
*_cleanup.md
*_report.md
*_migration*.md
TODO_*.md
implementation_plan*.md
# uppercase variants (same patterns, Linux case-sensitive fs)
*_ANALYSIS.md
*_REVIEW.md
*_AUDIT.md
*_CLEANUP.md
*_REPORT.md
*_MIGRATION*.md
TODO_*.MD
DELETE-*.md

